<title>USA: North Andover, Mass., won by Fidelity Capital.</title>
<headline>North Andover, Mass., won by Fidelity Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fidelity Capital Markets, Inc said it won $12.34 8 million of North Andover, Mass., municipal purpose limited tax loan of 1997 bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.268 percent.</p>
</text>
